#
# The 7100_fu_release_e6.exe embeds ~2.27MB of firmware in its .data section.
# No AES S-box present; cipher unknown (possibly XOR or plain binary).
# USB interface: Silicon Labs CP2102 (VID_10C4:PID_EA60) — USB-serial.
# Identified as standard PE32 executable; use normal PE analysis.
# =============================================================================
# (No separate magic — identified as standard Windows PE)

